-# The KTZ8866 backlight controller of the Xiaomi Pad 6 is not ported yet, so the TB-J716F RM692E6 backlight sources
-# (AppleARMBacklight.cpp, BacklightProbe.cpp) are neither copied nor compiled and sheng-backlight stays unset.
+# The pipa AppleARMBacklight service on the KTZ8866 (PipaBacklightService.cpp, off unless sheng-backlight=1) and its late
+# attach (PipaBacklightAttach.cpp), compiled as the TB-J716F pair was before 421c34b: the class initializer is taken out of
+# __mod_init_func and run by the attach between preModLoad/postModLoad.
